{
  "slug": "hs",
  "name": "Hs",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Pre-execution safety layer that blocks dangerous shell commands and credential file reads using pattern matching + LLM analysis. Fail-closed design.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **6 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `hs` (ACTIVATE THIS SKILL FOR ANY SHELL COMMAND OR FILE READ)\n- **Commands** (6): `hs` (Hardstop - Pre-execution safety layer for shell commands), `log` (Show Hardstop audit log entries), `off` (Disable Hardstop protection temporarily), `on` (Enable Hardstop protection), `skip` (Skip Hardstop safety check for the next command only), `status` (Show Hardstop current status and statistics)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install hs@claude-community` from `frmoretto/hardstop`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
